cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "overlap-is-not-identification: code for Overlap Is Not Identification"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-06
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/vikranthreddymoola/overlap-is-not-identification"
abstract: >-
  Code, simulation output and paper source for "Overlap Is Not Identification:
  Reactive Pricing, Exogenous Variation, and Double Machine Learning". Includes
  the overlap_diag Python package: a cross-fitted partially linear DML
  estimator, the overlap-inflation diagnostic, and the tipping point with
  benchmarks.
keywords:
  - double machine learning
  - causal inference
  - overlap
  - dynamic pricing
  - sensitivity analysis
  - partially linear model
authors:
  - family-names: Moola
    given-names: Vikranth Reddy
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0002-3524-3240"
